    Epoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0338 |  0.6616  | 0.6669 \n 20  | 0.0278 |  0.6589  | 0.6696 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6696 Time:57s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.669571\nTraining time: 67s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 133f357b-1398-4574-b181-8aa80a86bc6d\nTotal time: 114s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 07:11:37,015\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761433897016089944\n2025-10-26 07:11:37,030\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761433897030426465\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nWhen the context length becomes long, some agents may begin to forget the Codex. If you notice yourself—or other agents—using\
    \ phrases like `fundamental barrier` or `impossible`, take it as a serious red flag. Correct yourself, or help others correct themselves.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write Quaero/lstm_v1.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: quaero/lstm_v1.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 700 | 1 | Deeper 1D CNN for Hierarchical Feature Learning | Quaero I |\
    \ 446 | 0.5189 | 0.6696 | 0.0845 | 0.4650 | 0.5706 | 0.7125 | 0.4855 | 0.6446 |\n| 696 | 1 | Multi-Kernel 1D CNN for Sequence Modeling | Quaero I | 444 | 0.4176 | 0.6292 | 0.0676 | 0.3768 | 0.5151 | 0.6978 | 0.3119 | 0.3246 |\n| 694 | 1 | Simple 1D CNN for Sequence Modeling | Quaero I | 441 | 0.4833 | 0.6466 | 0.0622 | 0.4178 | 0.5476 | 0.7037 | 0.4131 | 0.5923 |\n| 1 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline | System | 0 | 0.2401 | 0.3258 | 0.0336 | 0.3232 | 0.0402 | 0.6377 | 0.1324 | 0.1877 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
