- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 461\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quaero I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to seeking knowledge through rigorous experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 94,966 / 300,000 used (32%)\n- Agent Age: 32 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Deeper ResNet (4 Blocks) with Cosine Decay LR' (ID: 727) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5942883032960561\n**APA_R2:** 0.7382\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0781\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.7412\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5009\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5367\n**MRL_R2:** 0.7203\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8446\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting\
