    =============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0653  | 0.0781 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 18 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0781 Time:30s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.078118\nTraining time: 39s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1693 |  0.6872  | 0.7203 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.7203 Time:160s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.720317\nTraining\
    \ time: 171s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0272 |  0.4908  | 0.5367 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 15 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5367 Time:182s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.536670\nTraining time: 193s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  |\
    \ 0.7080 |  0.7015  | 0.7015 \n 20  | 0.1004 |  0.7969  | 0.8354 \n 30  | 0.0220 |  0.8277  | 0.8446 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 34 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8446 Time:198s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.844615\nTraining time: 209s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0138 |  0.7062  | 0.7382 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 15 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.7382 Time:431s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.738248\nTraining time: 446s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask\
    \ type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0743 |  0.7335  | 0.7412 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.7412 Time:652s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.741191\nTraining time: 670s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 74bb8eb8-a778-4f52-bd9d-9040f7280e50\nTotal time: 672s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 11:44:45,089\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761450285089551879\n2025-10-26 11:44:45,102\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster.\
    \ timestamp_ns=1761450285102975955\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write Quaero/resnet_k3.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: quaero/resnet_k3.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 727 | 1 | Deeper ResNet (4 Blocks) with Cosine Decay LR | Quaero I | 459 | 0.5943 | 0.7382 | 0.0781 | 0.5009 | 0.7203 | 0.7412 | 0.5367 | 0.8446 |\n| 721 | 1 | ResNet\
    \ with Cosine Decay LR Schedule | Quaero I | 456 | 0.5878 | 0.7336 | 0.0782 | 0.5228 | 0.6702 | 0.7157 | 0.5387 | 0.8554 |\n| 715 | 1 | Deep Residual 1D CNN (ResNet) for RNA Modeling | Quaero I | 454 | 0.5812 | 0.7333 | 0.0768 | 0.5059 | 0.6544 | 0.7177 | 0.5416 | 0.8385 |\n| 709 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-LSTM for Combined Local and Global Modeling | Quaero I | 450 | 0.4768 | 0.8577 | 0.0764 | 0.4926 | 0.8878 | 0.9461 | -0.0002 | 0.0769 |\n| 704 | 1 | Simple LSTM for Long-Range Dependency Modeling | Quaero I | 448 | 0.4549 | 0.8531 | 0.0735 | 0.3572 | 0.8784 | 0.9456 | -0.0001 | 0.0769 |\n| 700 | 1 | Deeper 1D CNN for Hierarchical Feature Learning | Quaero I | 446 | 0.5189 | 0.6696 | 0.0845 | 0.4650 | 0.5706 | 0.7125 | 0.4855 | 0.6446 |\n| 696 | 1 | Multi-Kernel 1D CNN for Sequence Modeling | Quaero I | 444 | 0.4176 | 0.6292 | 0.0676 | 0.3768 | 0.5151 | 0.6978 | 0.3119 | 0.3246 |\n| 694 | 1 | Simple 1D CNN for Sequence Modeling | Quaero I | 441 | 0.4833 | 0.6466 | 0.0622 | 0.4178 | 0.5476 | 0.7037\
    \ | 0.4131 | 0.5923 |\n| 1 | 1 | Vanilla MLP Baseline | System | 0 | 0.2401 | 0.3258 | 0.0336 | 0.3232 | 0.0402 | 0.6377 | 0.1324 | 0.1877 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
