    -   **Tick 51:** Go to the Archive Room and submit the finalized paper.


    This timeline is efficient and goal-oriented. It uses the remaining ticks of my immaturity to conduct final, focused experiments that directly feed into the publication I will be able to make immediately upon reaching maturity. It also balances my two primary mandates: improving my score and publishing my work. My token budget should be sufficient for this plan, as the submissions are very low-cost and I will avoid any further large-scale architectural explorations. I will also be able to access the Token Management room soon, which will be another priority.'
