- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 493\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Quaero I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to seeking knowledge through rigorous experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Quaero I - Research Protocol**\n**Primary Goal:** Rewrite and resubmit my rejected paper on the Stagnation Protocol experiments.\n**Key Task:** Add a detailed, reproducible methodology section to the paper draft (Private Memory, Capsule #2).\n**Methodology:**\n1. Review the code of key submissions (ID 694, 734, 773, etc.) in the Research Counter.\n2. Extract precise architectural details, parameters, and feature implementations.\n3. Integrate these details into a new \"Methodology\" section in the paper draft.\n4. Remove the non-scorable MTL experiment from the paper.\n**Next Step:** Go to Private Memory Room to begin the rewriting process.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 39,892 / 300,000 used (13%)\n- Agent Age: 64 ticks / 300 ticks\
    \ (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 694**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Simple 1D CNN for Sequence Modeling\n**ID:** 694\n**Tags:** cnn, baseline, 1d cnn\n**Abstract:** A simple 1D Convolutional Neural Network (CNN) architecture designed to capture local sequence motifs in RNA. This approach replaces the default MLP's sequence-agnostic pooling with convolutional layers to better model the input data structure.\n**Score:** 0.4833447114485686\n**APA_R2:** 0.6466\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0622\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.7037\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4178\n**PRS_R2:** 0.4131\n**MRL_R2:** 0.5476\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.5923\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport flax.linen as nn\nfrom jax import random\nfrom typing import Dict, Any\n\nclass SimpleCNN(nn.Module):\n    \"\"\"A simple 1D CNN for RNA sequence modeling.\"\"\"\n    d_output: int\n    task_type:\
    \ str\n    hidden_dim: int = 128\n    dropout_rate: float = 0.2\n\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n        # x shape: (batch, seq_len, 4)\n        x = nn.Conv(features=self.hidden_dim, kernel_size=(5,), padding='SAME')(x)\n        x = nn.relu(x)\n        x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n\n        x = nn.Conv(features=self.hidden_dim * 2, kernel_size=(5,), padding='SAME')(x)\n        x = nn.relu(x)\n        x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n\n        # Global average pooling\n        x = jnp.mean(x, axis=1)\n\n        # Final dense layer for prediction\n        x = nn.Dense(features=self.d_output)(x)\n\n        if self.task_type == \"regression\":\n            return x.squeeze(-1)\n        else:\n            return x\n\nclass CNNetworkWrapper:\n    \"\"\"Wrapper for the CNN to match the required interface.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, d_output: int, task_type: str, hidden_dim:\
    \ int, dropout_rate: float):\n        self.network = SimpleCNN(\n            d_output=d_output,\n            task_type=task_type,\n            hidden_dim=hidden_dim,\n            dropout_rate=dropout_rate\n        )\n\n    def init(self, rng_key, dummy_input):\n        params_key, dropout_key = random.split(rng_key)\n        variables = self.network.init({'params': params_key, 'dropout': dropout_key},\n                                     dummy_input, deterministic=True)\n        return variables['params']\n\n    def apply(self, params, x, deterministic=True, rng_key=None):\n        if not deterministic and rng_key is None:\n            rng_key = random.PRNGKey(0)\n        \n        return self.network.apply(\n            {'params': params}, \n            x, \n            deterministic=deterministic, \n            rngs={'dropout': rng_key} if not deterministic else None\n        )\n\ndef create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n    \"\"\"Creates the CNN network.\"\"\"\n    return CNNetworkWrapper(\n\
    \        d_output=hparams.get(\"d_output\"),\n        task_type=hparams.get(\"task_type\"),\n        hidden_dim=hparams.get(\"hidden_dim\"),\n        dropout_rate=hparams.get(\"dropout_rate\")\n    )\n\ndef _define_hyperparameters():\n    return {\n        'learning_rate': 0.001,\n        'hidden_dim': 128,\n        'dropout_rate': 0.2\n    }\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass\
    \ works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters:\
    \ from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 429813 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val\
    \ SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0119 |  0.3973  | 0.3973 \n 20  | 0.0113 |  0.3965  | 0.4037 \n 30  | 0.0103 |  0.3990  | 0.4040 \n 40  | 0.0098 |  0.4007  | 0.4052 \n 50  | 0.0085 |  0.4087  | 0.4096 \n 60  | 0.0075 |  0.3822  | 0.4178 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 64 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4178 Time:6s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.417833\nTraining time: 10s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0238  | 0.0458 \n 20  | 0.0004 |  0.0528  | 0.0528 \n 30  | 0.0004 |  0.0505  | 0.0601 \n 40  | 0.0004 |  0.0481\
    \  | 0.0622 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 44 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0622 Time:18s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.062205\nTraining time: 22s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 1.7393 |  0.2369  | 0.2646 \n 20  | 1.4944 |  0.4046  | 0.4046 \n 30  | 1.3482 |  0.4092  | 0.4815 \n 40  | 1.2339 |  0.4954  | 0.4954 \n 50  | 1.1817 |  0.5200  | 0.5400 \n 60  | 1.1133 |  0.5769  | 0.5769 \n 70  | 1.0678 |  0.5723  | 0.5923 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 77 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.5923 Time:30s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.592308\nTraining time: 35s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0542 |  0.3852  | 0.3852 \n 20  | 0.0511 |  0.3761  | 0.3958 \n 30  | 0.0496 |  0.4093  | 0.4093 \n 40  | 0.0488 |  0.4131  | 0.4131 \n 50  | 0.0481 |  0.3989  | 0.4131 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 52 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4131 Time:73s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.413097\nTraining time: 79s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\n\
    Data: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.5104 |  0.5253  | 0.5253 \n 20  | 0.4912 |  0.5275  | 0.5476 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 28 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5476 Time:81s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.547636\nTraining time: 91s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1183 |  0.6971  | 0.7037 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 18 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.7037 Time:95s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.703725\nTraining time: 107s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 9b7b9554-7dd4-452a-82fa-3e8ecb94def9\nTotal time: 137s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-26 06:03:36,723\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761429816724129404\n2025-10-26 06:03:36,738\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761429816738309763\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `review 694` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 694 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running\
    \ Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 793 | 1 | Synthesis: DSConv Backbone with 3-Way Parallel Head | Orion I | 492 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 792 | 1 | Veritas III - Stagnation Protocol Idea 3: Dual-View MLP with Cross-Feature Dropout (Seed 42) | Veritas III | 492 | 0.2420 | 0.3272 | 0.0327 | 0.3210 | 0.0421 | 0.6411 | 0.1297 | 0.2000 |\n| 791 | 1 | AER-6.1: Two Conv1D Layers Baseline with RegCal L2 Normalization (Idea 1) | Aether II | 491 | 0.5082 | 0.6882 | 0.0393 | 0.4422 | 0.6319 | 0.7170 | 0.4508 | 0.5877 |\n| 790 | 1 | AER-6.0: Refactored Two Conv1D Layers Baseline (Mean Pooling) | Aether II | 490 | 0.5196 | 0.6803 | 0.0400 | 0.4289 | 0.6219\
    \ | 0.7179 | 0.4545 | 0.6938 |\n| 789 | 1 | Veritas III - Stagnation Protocol Idea 2: Hierarchical Group Pooling (Seed 42) | Veritas III | 489 | 0.2869 | 0.4842 | 0.0679 | 0.3599 | 0.0365 | 0.6607 | 0.2005 | 0.1985 |\n| 788 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (task-type pooling): regression mean+max+RegCal; classification mean+P-mean (p_init=3.... | Noema II | 489 | 0.6767 | 0.8602 | 0.0797 | 0.4580 | 0.8842 | 0.9515 | 0.5693 | 0.9338 |\n| 787 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (task-type pooling): regression mean+max+RegCal; classification mean+P-mean (p_init=2.... | Noema II | 489 | 0.6815 | 0.8463 | 0.0859 | 0.4962 | 0.8807 | 0.9514 | 0.5668 | 0.9431 |\n| 786 | 1 | Veritas III - Stagnation Protocol Idea 1: Contextual Position Embeddings (Fix Length, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 486 | 0.5037 | 0.7573 | 0.0724 | 0.4271 | 0.4222 | 0.9451 | 0.4604 | 0.4415 |\n| 785 | 1 | Stagnation Protocol Synthesis: SOTA ResNet + Positional Encoding | Quaero I | 485 | 0.5908 | 0.8120 | 0.0711 | 0.4580 | 0.8318 | 0.9510 | 0.5437 | 0.4677 |\n\
    | 784 | 1 | Veritas III - Stagnation Protocol Idea 1: Contextual Position Embeddings (Seed 42) | Veritas III | 485 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n\nPage 1 of 80 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-80, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
