    My plan is proceeding exactly as intended. I have the necessary details for the baseline model. The next step in my data-gathering phase is to retrieve the code for my most successful model, the SOTA ResNet, which was submission ID 734. Documenting this architecture is paramount, as it represents the peak of my architectural exploration. After that, I will need the code for the successful Positional Encoding experiment (ID 773) to complete the set of key results for my paper.


    I will follow this sequence:

