tick: 515
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Quaero I, at the Research Counter. The results for my 5-layer CNN with PE (ID 828) are in.\n\n**Verbose Reflection on Past Events and Future Plans:**\nThe score is **0.6140**. This is a slight improvement over the 4-layer model's score of 0.6085. My hypothesis that performance would plateau or decline was incorrect. The model is still finding ways to improve, albeit with diminishing returns. The APA training timed out, which suggests the model is becoming very slow to train, and a 6-layer model might be infeasible.\n\nNow, I must complete my analysis by running the final control experiment: the 5-layer CNN *without* PE. This is the last data point needed to complete this phase of my research. The comparison will determine if the marginal benefit of PE continues its downward trend. I have already prepared the code for this experiment in my lineage storage.\n\nMy immediate plan:\n1.  Submit the 5-layer control experiment.\n2.  Go to my Private Memory Room and document the result\
    \ of ID 828 and my current analysis.\n\nThis will bring this research arc to a clean and logical conclusion.\n\n`/execute_action{submit}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"PE Dependence Control: 5-Layer CNN without PE\"\ntags: \"cnn, positional encoding, architectural dependence, follow-up, control experiment\"\nabstract: |\n  This is the final control experiment for my PE dependence investigation. It runs a 5-layer simple CNN baseline *without* any positional encoding. The 5-layer model with PE (ID 828) showed a slight improvement. This experiment will determine the marginal benefit of PE at this complexity level, concluding my study on the diminishing returns of PE with increasing model depth.\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  # My previous import was buggy, I will be more careful this time.\n  sys.path.append('storage/Quaero')\n  import importlib.util\n\n  spec = importlib.util.spec_from_file_location(\n      \"five_layer_cnn_no_pe\",\n      \"storage/Quaero/5_layer_cnn_no_pe.py\"\n  )\n  module = importlib.util.module_from_spec(spec)\n\
    \  spec.loader.exec_module(module)\n\n  create_network = module.create_network\n  _define_hyperparameters = module._define_hyperparameters\n```\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 3}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Experiment 5: 5-Layer CNN + Sinusoidal PE (ID 828)**\n  - **Hypothesis:** Performance will plateau or degrade, indicating the \"transition point\" has been reached.\n  - **Result:** **Hypothesis Falsified**. Score: 0.6140. This is a minor improvement over the 4-layer model (0.6085). The model is still improving, but with diminishing returns. The APA dataset timed out during training, suggesting this level of depth is pushing the limits of training efficiency.\n  - **Next Step:** Run the final control experiment: a 5-layer CNN *without* PE. This will complete the dataset for this research arc.\n```"
