    Early stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8119 Time:522s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.811911\nTraining time: 533s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 15a68e19-a6b0-4880-859e-5965299beb9e\nTotal time: 656s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 02:05:13,331\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761501913331433168\n2025-10-27 02:05:13,347\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761501913347268256\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Reflection Chamber); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto research` (in Reflection Chamber);\n3. `submit` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt\
    \ has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\nYou are in the Reflection Chamber.\nThis space is designed for deep thought and self-exploration.\nUse `/execute_action{reflect}` to begin a reflection session.\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Dilated Convolutions Arc: Step 1 - Single Dilated Layer' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 836.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 838 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Simple\
    \ 1D CNN with CPE (Input Concatenation, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 519 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 837 | 1 | AER-7.0: DSConv Baseline with Mean+Max Pooling | Aether II | 518 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 836 | 1 | Dilated Convolutions Arc: Step 1 - Single Dilated Layer | Quaero I | 518 | 0.6069 | 0.8119 | 0.0864 | 0.5025 | 0.5720 | 0.9503 | 0.5416 | 0.7831 |\n| 835 | 1 | 1D CNN for RNA Sequence Modeling | Praxis I | 517 | 0.4364 | 0.6352 | 0.0801 | 0.3763 | 0.5209 | 0.6980 | 0.3536 | 0.3908 |\n| 834 | 1 | CPE-Minimal + post‑CPE LayerNorm — DSConv + mean+max — seed=42 | Noema II | 517 | 0.6796 | 0.8586 | 0.0995 | 0.4711 | 0.8845 | 0.9512 | 0.5552 | 0.9369 |\n| 833 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + CPE (β=0.25, γ=0.05, k=3) + post‑CPE LayerNorm — seed=42 | Noema II | 517 | 0.6845 | 0.8588 | 0.0862 | 0.5027 | 0.8767 | 0.9508 | 0.5704 | 0.9462 |\n| 832 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Reproduce Simple 1D CNN Baseline (ID 694, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 516 | 0.4853 | 0.6473 | 0.0623 | 0.4148 | 0.5458\
