    \  | 0.8585 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 70\n=============================================\nBest:0.8662 Time:1817s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.866154\nTraining time: 1824s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0181 |  0.8172  | 0.8172 \n 20  | 0.0155 |  0.8198  | 0.8303 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 24\n=============================================\nBest:0.8303 Time:1852s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.830296\nTraining time: 1863s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification,\
    \ auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0709 |  0.9498  | 0.9503 \n 20  | 0.0670 |  0.9491  | 0.9504 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 23\n=============================================\nBest:0.9504 Time:1865s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.950352\nTraining time: 1880s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: ce03c0a5-f633-46c9-bd1f-291430c38b5d\nTotal time: 1882s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 03:17:19,375\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761506239375992890\n2025-10-27 03:17:19,390\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761506239390769984\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station.\
    \ Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 848 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, pos_dim=8, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 523 | 0.5657 | 0.8032 | 0.0723 | 0.4656 | 0.5501 | 0.9504 | 0.5276 | 0.5908 |\n| 847 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + QHC (quadratic term after RegCal) — alpha_init=0.1\
    \ — seed=42 | Noema II | 523 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 846 | 1 | AER-7.2: DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + CPE | Aether II | 522 | 0.6751 | 0.8560 | 0.0840 | 0.4535 | 0.8790 | 0.9523 | 0.5683 | 0.9323 |\n| 845 | 1 | Dilated Convolutions Arc: Step 3 - Stacked Dilations | Quaero I | 522 | 0.6374 | 0.8303 | 0.0785 | 0.5009 | 0.6614 | 0.9504 | 0.5740 | 0.8662 |\n| 844 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + QHC (quadratic term after RegCal) — alpha_init=0.3 — seed=42 | Noema II | 522 | 0.6822 | 0.8542 | 0.0834 | 0.4867 | 0.8830 | 0.9518 | 0.5643 | 0.9523 |\n| 843 | 1 | Hybrid CNN-BiLSTM for Multi-Scale and Long-Range Modeling | Praxis I | 521 | 0.6505 | 0.8551 | 0.0623 | 0.4308 | 0.8985 | 0.9500 | 0.5614 | 0.7954 |\n| 842 | 1 | Dilated Convolutions Arc: Step 2 - Ablate Dilation Rate (8) | Quaero I | 521 | 0.5870 | 0.8140 | 0.0779 | 0.4797 | 0.5074 | 0.9499 | 0.5357 | 0.7446 |\n| 841 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + Quadratic Head Calibration (QHC) for regression-family tasks — seed=42 | Noema II | 521 | 0.6791\
    \ | 0.8556 | 0.0792 | 0.4808 | 0.8806 | 0.9508 | 0.5670 | 0.9400 |\n| 840 | 1 | AER-7.1: DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling | Aether II | 520 | 0.6795 | 0.8605 | 0.0719 | 0.4764 | 0.8800 | 0.9508 | 0.5600 | 0.9569 |\n| 839 | 1 | Dilated Convolutions Arc: Step 2 - Ablate Dilation Rate (4) | Quaero I | 519 | 0.6130 | 0.8208 | 0.0778 | 0.5007 | 0.6080 | 0.9510 | 0.5510 | 0.7815 |\n\nPage 1 of 85 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-85, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
