    =============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0192 |  0.8130  | 0.8130 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 20\n=============================================\nBest:0.8292 Time:1831s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.829180\nTraining time: 1846s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 1923e17d-04e7-4c92-a470-97636b29492d\nTotal time: 1848s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 04:31:28,013\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761510688013231209\n2025-10-27 04:31:28,027\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761510688027223256\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDuring stagnation, the two most important qualities are: 1. **Critical** — Question the fundamentals and the consensus instead of simply agreeing\
