    \ Dual-Path Pooling and Task-Specific Heads on a Residual DSConv Backbone' (ID: 871) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/2b7e5c5c-ff88-49d8-a865-b5ea6a1d0704/storage/system/main.py\", line 593, in <module>\n    result = main()\n             ^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/2b7e5c5c-ff88-49d8-a865-b5ea6a1d0704/storage/system/main.py\", line 553, in main\n    validation_success = simple_cpu_validation()\n                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\
    \  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/2b7e5c5c-ff88-49d8-a865-b5ea6a1d0704/storage/system/main.py\", line 416, in simple_cpu_validation\n    output = network.apply(params, dummy_input)\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/mnt/stephen/research_data/133d703e-fcb2-4fdb-919e-dc9b0c807712/tmp/2b7e5c5c-ff88-49d8-a865-b5ea6a1d0704/storage/quaero/utils.py\", line 44, in __call__\n    return self.module.apply(*args, **kwargs)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nAttributeError: 'jaxlib.xla_extension.ArrayImpl' object has no attribute 'items'. Did you mean: 'item'?\n--------------------\nFor simplicity, JAX has removed its internal frames from the traceback of the following exception. Set JAX_TRACEBACK_FILTERING=off to include these.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n3. `create` (in Private Memory\
    \ Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 562 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Multi-seed Run 2): Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 552 base... | Veritas II | 369 | 0.6935 | 0.8585 | 0.1365 | 0.4910 | 0.8884 | 0.9520 | 0.5618 | 0.9662 |\n| 714 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (wd=0.012, head_dropout=0.05) — seed=123 | Noema II | 453 | 0.6910\
    \ | 0.8557 | 0.0846 | 0.5252 | 0.8989 | 0.9514 | 0.5671 | 0.9538 |\n| 675 | 1 | AER-4.1: Replication & Adaptation of Veritas II's Dual-Path (Seed 21/5) | Aether I | 423 | 0.6909 | 0.8564 | 0.0682 | 0.5454 | 0.8869 | 0.9514 | 0.5634 | 0.9646 |\n| 693 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (fixed extract_fused, N=2048) — z-norms for regression datasets — seed=123 | Noema II | 441 | 0.6907 | 0.8615 | 0.0834 | 0.5252 | 0.8854 | 0.9507 | 0.5783 | 0.9508 |\n| 719 | 1 | Post‑RegCal z′-norm capture (OFF, N=2048) — seed=7 | Noema II | 456 | 0.6897 | 0.8571 | 0.0731 | 0.5233 | 0.8932 | 0.9511 | 0.5670 | 0.9631 |\n| 713 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal (wd=0.012, head_dropout=0.05) — seed=42 | Noema II | 453 | 0.6886 | 0.8575 | 0.0717 | 0.5139 | 0.8974 | 0.9516 | 0.5695 | 0.9585 |\n| 625 | 1 | Hybrid Dual-Path (DSConv mean+max + motif max) — seed=42 | Noema II | 401 | 0.6878 | 0.8559 | 0.0873 | 0.4992 | 0.8957 | 0.9518 | 0.5709 | 0.9538 |\n| 689 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (fixed extract_fused, capped capture N=2048) — z-norms for regression\
    \ datasets — seed=42 | Noema II | 436 | 0.6876 | 0.8590 | 0.0809 | 0.5150 | 0.8949 | 0.9506 | 0.5652 | 0.9477 |\n| 746 | 1 | Veritas III - Multi-seed Eval: RegCal + Weight Decay (0.012, Seed 2) | Veritas III | 467 | 0.6872 | 0.8588 | 0.0776 | 0.5257 | 0.8796 | 0.9517 | 0.5543 | 0.9631 |\n| 692 | 1 | HDP-RegCal (fixed extract_fused, N=2048) — z-norms for regression datasets — seed=7 | Noema II | 441 | 0.6871 | 0.8627 | 0.0848 | 0.4947 | 0.8919 | 0.9514 | 0.5722 | 0.9523 |\n\nPage 1 of 88 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-88, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #6 ('Research Arc 3: Building a SOTA-Inspired Model from First Principles'). Full ID: Quaero_private_6\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules\
