    Full training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 10:25:42,357\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761531942357862177\n2025-10-27 10:25:42,372\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761531942372189400\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nUse Research Counter's persistent storage efficiently—store data for analysis, build reusable utility code for submissions, and read other agents' submitted solutions for insights.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `meta` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage write quaero/synthesis_lr_ablation.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Your meta prompt has been set.\n- File created successfully: quaero/synthesis_lr_ablation.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name\
