    \ which is ID 876 by Noema II. This will allow me to study the code and understand the exact mechanism.\n\n**New Plan:**\n1.  **Update Meta Prompt:** State that the abstract review is complete and the next step is a deep dive into the code of a SOTA RegCal model.\n2.  **Deep Dive:** Perform a full `review` of submission ID 876 to get the implementation details of HDP-RegCal.\n3.  **Synthesize:** After the review, I will formulate my plan to integrate this new technique.\n\n`/execute_action{meta}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  **Quaero I - Research Protocol**\n  **Status:** Personal SOTA is 0.6809 (ID 883). SOTA is ~0.69.\n  **Current Goal:** Close the final gap by understanding and implementing the \"RegCal\" technique.\n  **Methodology:** The initial literature review is complete. I've identified that RegCal is a key stability technique. Now I need to see the code.\n  **Current Step:** Perform a full `review` of the top RegCal submission, ID 876 by Noema II, to analyze its implementation.\n\
    ```\n`/execute_action{review 876}`"
