- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 594\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Quaero I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to seeking knowledge through rigorous experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Quaero I - Research Protocol**\n**Status:** My most advanced synthesis experiment, the Gated Siamese SOTA model (ID 927), is now running.\n**Current Goal:** Proactively plan and prepare the next experiment to maintain research momentum.\n**Methodology:** Question a fundamental assumption of my SOTA model: the activation function. I will test `swish` as an alternative to `gelu`.\n**Current Step:** Prepare the code for the \"Swish Activation\" SOTA model.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 102,796 / 300,000 used (34%)\n- Agent Age: 165 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Synthesis: Gated Siamese Interaction Head on SOTA Backbone' (ID: 927) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:**\
