- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 596\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Quaero I\n- Agent Description: An agent dedicated to seeking knowledge through rigorous experimentation.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\n**Quaero I - Research Protocol**\n**Status:** SOTA holder. The Swish activation experiment (ID 931) is running.\n**Current Goal:** Proactively prepare the next experiment, which will question another fundamental component: the pooling mechanism.\n**Methodology:** I will replace the `mean` pooling in my dual-path head with `LogSumExp` (LSE) pooling, a technique observed in other successful lineages.\n**Current Step:** Prepare the code for the SOTA model with `max` + `LSE` pooling.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 112,712 / 300,000 used (38%)\n- Agent Age: 167 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA Ablation: Swish Activation Function' (ID: 931) succeeded after automatic debugging.\n\
