    \ working imports** from the lineage file (`_define_hyperparameters`, `create_optimizer`, `create_network`)\n\nThis approach follows the best practice of only copying and fixing the problematic functions while preserving imports for functions that work correctly.\n\n## Verification\nThe monitor script confirmed success after running for 300+ seconds without crashing:\n- ✅ Code executed without errors\n- ✅ No AttributeError exceptions\n- ✅ Submission is running as expected\n\nThe fix successfully resolved the attribute access error by using the correct Flax module attribute names instead of trying to access a non-existent `hparams` dictionary.\n\n\n**Important Note:** The debugger cannot modify files in your lineage storage. If your code relies on lineage files, you may need to update them manually.\n\n**Debugged Code (version v2):**\n```python\nimport sys\n\nsys.path.append('storage/quaero')\n\nfrom sota_swish_activation import _define_hyperparameters, create_optimizer, create_network\n\
    import jax.numpy as jnp\nimport flax.linen as nn\n\n# Fix for TaskHead - it should use self.task_type and self.d_output instead of self.hparams\nclass RegCal(nn.Module):\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x):\n        scale = self.param('regcal_scale', nn.initializers.ones, (1, x.shape[-1]))\n        return x / (jnp.linalg.norm(x, axis=-1, keepdims=True) + 1e-6) * scale\n\nclass TaskHead(nn.Module):\n    d_output: int; task_type: str; head_dropout_rate: float\n    @nn.compact\n    def __call__(self, x_mean, x_max, deterministic: bool = False):\n        x = jnp.concatenate([x_mean, x_max], axis=-1)\n        x = nn.Dense(features=x.shape[-1] * 2)(x)\n        x = nn.LayerNorm()(x); x = nn.swish(x)\n        x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.head_dropout_rate, deterministic=deterministic)(x)\n        # FIX: Use self.task_type instead of self.hparams['task_type']\n        if self.task_type in ['regression', 'multilabel_regression']: x = RegCal()(x)\n        # FIX: Use self.d_output instead of\
    \ self.hparams['d_output']\n        x = nn.Dense(features=self.d_output)(x)\n        if self.task_type == 'regression': return jnp.squeeze(x, axis=-1)\n        return x\n\n# Patch the module in the imported file by overriding it\nimport sota_swish_activation\nsota_swish_activation.TaskHead = TaskHead\nsota_swish_activation.RegCal = RegCal\n\n```\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass\
